AIRK @@VERSION@@ — @@ARCH@@

This installer contains the native AIRK command-line application, local MCP
server, bundled models and license notices. It installs no VS Code extension.

Open "Install AIRK.command" to start the native setup in Terminal. Setup reviews
the per-user installation or upgrade, then guides you through source selection
and connecting a supported MCP client. No administrator password is required.

After successful setup, eject this disk image. Setup prints the installed AIRK
executable path and instructions for adding it to PATH; it does not edit your
shell startup files. Keep your original source folders in place. To remove AIRK,
invoke the installed executable with "uninstall" and review the native cleanup.
Index data and source preservation are reported separately.

The disk image and native application use Ioka LLC's Developer ID Application
signature and Apple notarization. This package contains no account credentials.
